# Binary assets are stored as regular Git blobs (not Git LFS) so GitHub Pages
# can serve docs/assets and a plain `git clone` gets a runnable app.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.svg -text

# 3D models
*.glb binary
*.bin binary

# Database backups
*.bacpac binary
*.bak binary

# Fonts
*.otf binary
*.ttf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.eot binary

# Videos
*.mp4 binary
*.mov binary
*.avi binary
